61,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is the safest for the budget, but Option B sounds like a real camp! I'm torn between the two.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option B sounds lovely. Shared dormitories often bring people together in a way that separate rooms do not.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option A is too disruptive to the local routine. Option B is better, but we must check if the canteen is open.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option C is the most adventurous! But wait, it's a whole building... that means the scary non-refundable deposits!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option C is too risky financially. Option A is the most stable, but Option B is a reasonable compromise.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, exactly! If we go with C and someone cancels, we're in trouble. I think B is the best middle ground.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"I agree. In Option B, the shared spaces will help the younger students feel more comfortable with the seniors.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,Option B is acceptable if the facility handles the meals. I cannot support any option that requires us to cook.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Rin,,"I don't want to stay on campus! That's not a camp, that's just... school! I vote for the Mountain Centre!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"Option B uses the prefecture rate sheet, which is transparent. It is the most responsible choice for the club's finances.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mio,,"It sounds like we all like Option B! It's a real trip, but it's not as risky as the lodge.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It will be wonderful to see everyone waking up and eating together. I believe it will heal the divisions.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"As long as the municipal system handles the bookings and the food, it reduces the administrative burden on the organizers.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Rin,,I hope the beds are actually beds and not just mats! But it's way better than staying at the hall!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I am satisfied with Option B. The costs are predictable, and it fulfills the purpose of a training camp.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Mio,,Let's do it! Option B it is!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am looking forward to it. I will make sure to welcome everyone warmly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Let's ensure the booking is handled efficiently to avoid last-minute stress.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! Adventure time! I'll start packing my gear!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I will double-check the final numbers before we announce the fee to the members.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
